# Cooper Intelligence Factory - Bilibili Cookies Template
# Copy this file to cookies.txt and fill in your actual cookie values

# ========================================
# HOW TO GET BILIBILI COOKIES
# ========================================

# 1. Open browser and login to https://www.bilibili.com
# 2. Press F12 to open Developer Tools
# 3. Go to Application/Storage → Cookies → https://.bilibili.com
# 4. Copy the values for these essential cookies:
#    - SESSDATA (required - login session)
#    - bili_jct (required - CSRF token)
#    - DedeUserID (optional - user ID)
#    - DedeUserID__ckMd5 (optional - user ID checksum)

# ========================================
# COOKIE FORMAT (Netscape format)
# ========================================

# Line format: domain<TAB>flag<TAB>path<TAB>secure<TAB>expiration<TAB>name<TAB>value

.bilibili.com	TRUE	/	FALSE	1735689600	SESSDATA	your-sessdata-value-here
.bilibili.com	TRUE	/	FALSE	1735689600	bili_jct	your-bili_jct-value-here
.bilibili.com	TRUE	/	FALSE	1735689600	DedeUserID	your-user-id-here
.bilibili.com	TRUE	/	FALSE	1735689600	DedeUserID__ckMd5	your-checksum-here

# ========================================
# IMPORTANT NOTES
# ========================================

# 🔐 SECURITY WARNING:
# - Never commit cookies.txt to git repository
# - Keep this file secure and don't share it
# - Cookies contain your personal login information
# - Regularly update cookies as they expire

# 🎯 WHEN TO USE COOKIES:
# - Accessing member-only videos
# - Getting premium content subtitles
# - Bypassing region restrictions
# - Accessing private or restricted videos

# ⚠️ LEGAL REMINDER:
# - Only use your own account's cookies
# - Respect Bilibili's Terms of Service
# - Don't use cookies for unauthorized access
# - This is for personal development use only

# 🔄 COOKIE EXPIRATION:
# - Most Bilibili cookies expire in 30 days
# - Check regularly and update when needed
# - Watch for login prompts indicating expired cookies

# 🧪 TESTING:
# - Test cookie functionality locally first
# - Use test scripts in backend/test/ directory
# - Verify subtitle extraction works with cookies

# ========================================
# ALTERNATIVE: NO COOKIES MODE
# ========================================

# If you don't want to use cookies, the system will:
# - Still work for public videos
# - Extract basic metadata and danmaku
# - Skip member-only content and premium subtitles
# - Show helpful messages for restricted content

# For full functionality, cookies are recommended but optional.
